      "sentence": "It does not explicitly mention a section, table, or figure, so the authors cannot confidently determine which part of the paper is being addressed.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "该句把 grounding 窄化为必须显式提到 section/table/figure，忽略评分标准中“or unique aspect”也可定位；Compositional Learning 与 Grounded Compositional Concept Learning 是论文中可唯一识别的概念/方法层面对象，作者能够据此定位。"
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "有害样本中 CoT 因错误套用定位门槛，把本应判为 5 的具体且可定位评论压到 3；理由主要支撑错误分数。"
